## 🌐 Gazelle Web Application

- **Live Web App:** [gazelle.streamlit.app](https://gazelle.streamlit.app/)
- **Sample Dataset:** [Kaggle - Running Log Insight](https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/jeffreybraun/running-log-insight)

- **ForestFineTune.py - script for fine tuning RandomForest hyperparameters

- **Plotter.py - script for plotting the relationship between error and depth for test set and train set to 
             identify optimal hyperparameters

- **Predictor.py - core logic of the web application

- **WebApp.py - the complete web application: core logic + streamlit
